OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested after boy injured
OL,4,Ain sword attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old was arrested overnight on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of assault occasioning actual
OL,8,Fbodily harm and affray. An 18-year-old
OL,9,Fwas held on suspicion of possession of
OL,10,Fan offensive weapon, assault
OL,11,Foccasioning actual bodily harm and
OL,12,Faffray. Meanwhile another 17-year-old
OL,13,Fboy was arrested on suspicion of
OL,14,Fassisting an offender.
